            "body": "Your read path fails quietly. The user sees stale data. No error. No loading. Just… wrong.\n\nThe fix: every read carries a version. Server increments on write. Client compares on read. Mismatch = refetch.\n\nThree lines in the saga. Zero silent failures.\n\nThis is the read-path term. The Agent Skill encodes it. The practice question runs in your browser.\n\nTry it free on Elegant. Link in description.\n\n#frontend #server #react #saga #webdev #shorts"
